Appendix H: Statement on Empirical Status

This document is a theoretical specification. No experiments have been conducted. No code has been trained. No physical tests have been performed. The empirical protocols described in Appendix F are proposed designs with pre-registered thresholds; they are not results. The transition model described in Appendix D is a proposed estimation protocol; no parameters have been estimated. The privacy guarantees described in Appendix C are mathematical properties of the proposed mechanisms; they have not been verified by implementation.

The contribution of this work is the mathematical framework, the architectural design, and the evaluation protocol. Empirical validation is future work and would require:

1. Implementation of the HLN prototype.
2. Partnering with at least one Continuum of Care.
3. Obtaining IRB approval.
4. Conducting the phased evaluation described in Section 4 and Appendix F.

